#!/usr/bin/env briar
# Folium

A leaf library: no `principale`, one type, one public function and one
`interior` (static) helper that stays private. Reached by `radix`
directly, through `media`, and through `sub/ramus` - linked once.

<c!>
nomen structura {
    s32 valor;
} FoliumRes;

interior s32
folium_secretum (vacuum)
{
    redde I;
}

s32
folium_duplicare (s32 x)
{
    redde (x + x) * folium_secretum();
}
</c>
